      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7304/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir milk, whipped topping, and pudding mix together in a medium bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MCXLi7tS5pG8noNRKpxYtg9h6ZE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-7304-elcair-cake-ddmfs-step1-3x4-2391-7de85843d100440db6f65598220acd5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7304/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange a single layer of graham cracker squares in the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jVwj4DKkMvl0UPkdQhZjzVXOw1M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-7304-elcair-cake-ddmfs-step2-3x4-2392-5b9b58d3c14b4062856c496c99eddcb6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7304/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly spread half of the pudding mixture over the crackers; top with another layer of crackers and the remaining pudding mixture. Top with a final layer of graham crackers. Cover and refrigerate for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hKxCrhp1FWIzp-DIEUtgeaaQyGc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-7304-elcair-cake-ddmfs-step6-3x4-2396-e41a6abafb1649bda0eb68a5a8d74924.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7304/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting over the chilled cake up to the edges of the pan. Cover again and chill for at least 3 ½ hours before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
